title: "AMD Phoenix NPU PQC Suite: Interactive Frontend & Hardware Dashboard"
abstract: "An interactive web dashboard, cryptographic playground, and physical silicon dispatch interface for device-resident Post-Quantum Cryptography (FIPS 202 SHA-3/SHAKE, FIPS 203 ML-KEM, and FIPS 204 ML-DSA) on the AMD Phoenix NPU (Ryzen 7 7840HS / Ryzen 9 7940HS w/ AIE2 / XDNA1 Architecture)."
